            ['Turning a blind eye due to profitability', 'Sanctioning without analysis'],
            'I analyse the size and cause of the breach, then escalate per the governance procedure without delay. With the team we build a plan to return within the limit by a set date. Profitability does not justify an unapproved exception: if a higher limit is justified it must be formally requested and approved.',
            'analysis,escalate,plan,independence'],
    ],
    ['code' => 'risk-culture', 'prof' => 'risk-manager', 'type' => 'behavioral', 'lvl' => [2, 5], 'diff' => 3, 'sec' => 210, 'skills' => ['stakeholder_management', 'communication'],
