            ['Imposing the control by authority only', 'No measurable result'],
            'The payments team saw a four eyes check as too heavy. I showed them two recent incidents and their cost. Then I ran a workshop to simplify the control, limiting it to transfers above 10,000. It was adopted within a month and payment incidents fell by 60 % over the year.',
