            ['Hiding the delay until the last minute', 'Blaming the team'],
            'On a migration project we were six weeks late at the midpoint. I found two causes: late testing and a dependency on a vendor. I replanned the critical path, introduced weekly testing and obtained two extra weeks of support. I presented the plan transparently to the sponsor. We delivered only two weeks late, with no major incident.',
            'cause,plan,sponsor,delivered'],
    ],
    ['code' => 'pm-fr-kickoff', 'prof' => 'project-manager-fr', 'type' => 'technical', 'lvl' => [2, 5], 'diff' => 2, 'sec' => 180, 'skills' => ['project_methodology', 'organisation'],
        'fr' => ['Comment cadrez-vous un projet avant son lancement ?', 'Objectifs, périmètre, parties prenantes, planning, risques, gouvernance.',
            ['Objectifs et périmètre|objectif,perimetre,livrable,hors perimetre,smart', 'Parties prenantes|parties prenantes,sponsor,raci,utilisateurs', 'Planning et ressources|planning,jalons,ressources,budget,charge', 'Risques et gouvernance|risque,gouvernance,comite,reporting'],
            ['Démarrer sans objectifs mesurables', 'Oublier de définir ce qui est hors périmètre'],
