            ['Starting without measurable objectives', 'Not defining what is out of scope'],
            'I write a project charter signed off by the sponsor: measurable objectives, scope and out of scope, deliverables. I map stakeholders with a RACI matrix. I build a plan with milestones and resources, an initial risk register and governance: monthly steering committee and weekly project meeting.',
            'objective,scope,raci,risk'],
