            ['Always scheduling at the same unfavourable time', 'Deciding everything orally'],
            'I set a short common slot for essentials and rotate inconvenient times. Most work is asynchronous: written decisions, a shared tracking board and systematic minutes. Each task has a clear owner. For cohesion I organise informal moments and, if possible, an in-person kick-off.',
            'time zone,asynchronous,owner,cohesion'],
    ],
    ['code' => 'pm-risk', 'prof' => 'project-manager', 'type' => 'technical', 'lvl' => [2, 5], 'diff' => 3, 'sec' => 180, 'skills' => ['project_methodology', 'risk_compliance'],
